title: "construction-safety-sd-mcs: System Dynamics + Monte Carlo simulation for construction safety risk quantification"
abstract: "A reproducible SD + MCS framework that quantifies accident probability, cost distribution and schedule loss for construction safety investment schemes, with common random numbers and bootstrap confidence intervals."
